        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5e69ad7a-c6e3-3957-b2d9-5fa0e03046d9",
                "word": "toetssteen",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cd556dc8-6481-4378-a38d-a592b00bbc75",
                        "entry_id": "5e69ad7a-c6e3-3957-b2d9-5fa0e03046d9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "toetsstenen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fddb8e43-193a-3abb-8292-bb52b9d267f7",
                        "entry_id": "5e69ad7a-c6e3-3957-b2d9-5fa0e03046d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "diepzwarte vorm van lydiet die gebruikt wordt bij het bepalen van het goudgehalte in een legering"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8982c393-2c32-3b46-a8df-371b06e9d08a",
                        "entry_id": "5e69ad7a-c6e3-3957-b2d9-5fa0e03046d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "proef om de kwaliteit van iets vast te stellen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c5324ee-d332-46a2-926d-9791a67b0b5e",
                                "sense_id": "8982c393-2c32-3b46-a8df-371b06e9d08a",
                                "text": "Volgens onderzoek (Chatham House) meent 55 procent van de ondervraagden uit tien Europese landen zelfs dat ‘elke verdere migratie uit moslimlanden moet stoppen’. Je kunt natuurlijk aanvoeren dat die weigeraars geen christen zijn, of onvolmaakte christenen. Dat neemt niet weg dat die mensen de christelijke deugden niet als de fundering of toetssteen van hun politieke keuzes zien."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c907083-f388-4470-9cd7-406c80ec1d79",
                                "sense_id": "8982c393-2c32-3b46-a8df-371b06e9d08a",
                                "text": "De voortvarende ontwikkeling van Luchthaven Twente is volgens hem 'de toetssteen'voor het nieuwe provinciebestuur. De SER vindt die van essentieel belang voor het Twentse bedrijfsleven. Hij hoopt niet dat er vertraging plaatsvindt door 'stroperige'procedures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18107ccf-ee8b-4559-b1a2-446e5dfcaa9b",
                                "sense_id": "8982c393-2c32-3b46-a8df-371b06e9d08a",
                                "text": "'Samen met een Engelse collega heb ik ooit een kerngroep van een kleine honderd tekeningen bijeengebracht: werken die, hetzij omdat ze gesigneerd zijn, hetzij omdat ze als voorstudie voor een ets of schilderij hebben gediend, onomstotelijk van Rembrandt zelf zijn. Die zijn dus bruikbaar als toetssteen voor andere tekeningen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5813be17-0c19-4746-a7ff-f9d8e1180ed9",
                        "source_entry_id": "5e69ad7a-c6e3-3957-b2d9-5fa0e03046d9",
                        "source_sense_id": "fddb8e43-193a-3abb-8292-bb52b9d267f7",
                        "source_sense_description": "steen voor het bepalen van het goudgehalte",
                        "target_lang_word": "touchstone",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "touchstone",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be5f5094-2b64-31b1-8995-cce04c3d98d4",
                                        "entry_id": "6ea11009-3382-3a87-9cf6-c078ef5da581",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stone used to verify the quality of gold alloys by rubbing them in order to leave a visible trace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8aa1cd67-d1bd-3a4f-910c-093732f96b9e",
                                        "entry_id": "6ea11009-3382-3a87-9cf6-c078ef5da581",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A standard of comparison or evaluation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c27ab2ec-15be-4fc9-a295-f27a73870955",
                                                "sense_id": "8aa1cd67-d1bd-3a4f-910c-093732f96b9e",
                                                "text": "The foregoing doctrine affords us also a touchstone for the trial of spirits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9bffb0a-0937-41ef-b1de-678e4bf88d23",
                                                "sense_id": "8aa1cd67-d1bd-3a4f-910c-093732f96b9e",
                                                "text": "\"Expectation of life\" is an elastic term: the touchstone here is rather the aggregate amount of work that the locomotive does during its working life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d648cb87-1c88-4afe-bd1b-78e47ddd52ac",
                                                "sense_id": "8aa1cd67-d1bd-3a4f-910c-093732f96b9e",
                                                "text": "Although there has not been very much direct treatment of the Holocaust in analytic moral philosophy, the Nazis appear again and again as examples or touchstones in the construction of moral theories."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68d1fbc8-ea62-4453-85c3-40ed39a7438b",
                                                "sense_id": "8aa1cd67-d1bd-3a4f-910c-093732f96b9e",
                                                "text": "In the print firestorm that followed the publication of the royal couple's letters, the generalissima was one polemical touchstone. The Annotations to The Kings Cabinet Opened itself depicted the queen as an enemy to king and country: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eb3dc36-8c07-419e-be6b-539ad806d295",
                                                "sense_id": "8aa1cd67-d1bd-3a4f-910c-093732f96b9e",
                                                "text": "Brokeback Mountain did take home three Oscars, including a prestigious best director prize for Ang Lee, and remains a beloved gay touchstone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "66a8f409-1a9d-4abe-9b68-8ca1eda6de7d",
                        "source_entry_id": "5e69ad7a-c6e3-3957-b2d9-5fa0e03046d9",
                        "source_sense_id": "8982c393-2c32-3b46-a8df-371b06e9d08a",
                        "source_sense_description": "testmiddel, maatstaf",
                        "target_lang_word": "criterion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "criterion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1c135db-69bd-3167-8d5b-ed9657c215ec",
                                        "entry_id": "ffb853b8-ec97-3fe2-acdd-532dceab032a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A standard, test, or requirement by which individual things or people may be compared and judged; a gauge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6d64ee4-c169-408a-a6eb-cbf2b880dc57",
                                                "sense_id": "d1c135db-69bd-3167-8d5b-ed9657c215ec",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: benchmark"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abe42da4-0823-4156-a9cf-41e17b46746d",
                                                "sense_id": "d1c135db-69bd-3167-8d5b-ed9657c215ec",
                                                "text": "criterion of choice, of decision, of selection"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2bb4ec4d-bccd-462f-90db-2790fc4062f8",
                                                "sense_id": "d1c135db-69bd-3167-8d5b-ed9657c215ec",
                                                "text": "Knowledge has come to her too soon—knowledge of evil, unqualified by the general charities which longer experience infallibly brings; but her age has lent its own freshness to this first great emotion; it becomes unconsciously a criterion, and the judgment is harsh, because the remembrance is bitter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bea3d50-1594-438c-808c-21887d4528ff",
                                                "sense_id": "d1c135db-69bd-3167-8d5b-ed9657c215ec",
                                                "text": "The Enlightment worldview, which considered the order of \"Nature\" as a basis and, at the same time, the subject of explorations of scientific natural sciences, has, at the same time, considered this order as a criterion of the artistically-aesthetic qualities of art. From an \"ideological\" point of view, it liberated art from its feudal religious and courtly servitude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48936ab0-fb2b-4eea-b0e4-96429614dc55",
                                                "sense_id": "d1c135db-69bd-3167-8d5b-ed9657c215ec",
                                                "text": "Congratulations on managing to use the phrase “preponderant criterion” in a chart (“On your marks”, November 9th). Was this the work of a kakorrhaphiophobic journalist set a challenge by his colleagues, or simply an example of glossolalia?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bde52f0b-af91-42f8-9d1d-edcb9ce44eb6",
                        "source_entry_id": "5e69ad7a-c6e3-3957-b2d9-5fa0e03046d9",
